    "kind": "flowchart",
    "sourcePage": 2,
    "paragraphs": [
      "A flowchart is a diagram that uses symbols and arrows to represent the steps and decisions in an algorithm.",
      "Flowcharts allow programmers to plan and understand the logic of a program before writing code.",
      "Arrows connect the symbols and show the order in which the steps occur.",
      "Different symbols have different meanings."
    ],
